  {
    "speaker": "番組スタッフ",
    "text": "それでは、インタビューを始めさせていただきますね",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "番組スタッフ",
    "text": "今回はチーム対抗の旅番組で、どちらのチームが\r\n先にゴールにたどり着くか、という企画です",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "番組スタッフ",
    "text": "田中さんは、旅行とかされたりしますか？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003"
  },
  {
    "id": 3005017010060,
    "speaker": "摩美々",
    "text": "旅行…………",
    "charAnim1": "think",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "mamimi",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "charType": "idols",
    "charId": "1030050010",
    "charPosition": {
      "x": 568,
      "y": 640,
      "order": 0
    },
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "to",
      "alpha": 1,
      "time": 100
    },
    "voice": "produce_events/300501701/3005017010060"
  },
  {
    "id": 3005017010070,
    "speaker": "摩美々",
    "text": "まぁ、仕事で遠くに行くことは\r\nありますケドー",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "mamimi",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/300501701/3005017010070"
  },
  {
    "id": 3005017010080,
    "speaker": "摩美々",
    "text": "そういうの\r\n旅行って言うんですかねー？",
    "charAnim1": "wait4",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "mamimi",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/300501701/3005017010080"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "番組スタッフ",
    "text": "そうですね、もちろんお仕事のロケも\r\n旅行と言えなくもないですが……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "番組スタッフ",
    "text": "例えば、田中さんはアイドルをされながら\r\n高校にも通われてると思うんですけど──",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait_s",
    "charLabel": "mamimi",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "番組スタッフ",
    "text": "──高校のご友人と一緒にどこかに行ったとか\r\nそういうエピソードはあったりします？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003"
  },
  {
    "id": 3005017010090,
    "speaker": "摩美々",
    "text": "高校…………",
    "charAnim1": "anger1",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "mamimi",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/300501701/3005017010090"
  },
  {
    "id": 3005017010100,
    "speaker": "摩美々",
    "text": "いや、ないですねー",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "mamimi",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/300501701/3005017010100"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "番組スタッフ",
    "text": "じゃあ、そうですね……\r\n高校のご友人と一緒に旅行に行ってみたいとか……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "番組スタッフ",
    "text": "そういうことは思ったり？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003"
  },
  {
    "id": 3005017010110,
    "speaker": "摩美々",
    "text": "特には……高校に友達はいますケド\r\nそもそも旅行とかめんどーなほうなんでー",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "mamimi",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/300501701/3005017010110"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "番組スタッフ",
    "text": "そ、そうですか……\r\nでは、高校生活についてお聞きしますが……",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait_s",
    "charLabel": "mamimi",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "番組スタッフ",
    "text": "旅行でなくても\r\n普通の高校生活を楽しむ時間もなかなかないと思います",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "番組スタッフ",
    "text": "寂しくはないですか────？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003"
  },
  {
    "id": 3005017010120,
    "speaker": "摩美々",
    "text": "寂しく……",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "mamimi",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/300501701/3005017010120"
  },
  {
    "textFrame": "off",
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 1300
  },
  {
    "id": 3005017010130,
    "speaker": "摩美々",
    "text": "ある意味、普通の高校生活を送ってはいないかもですケド\r\nまったく寂しくはないですねー",
    "charAnim1": "anger2",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "mamimi",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/300501701/3005017010130"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "番組スタッフ",
    "text": "うーん……なるほど……\r\nわかりました",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait_s",
    "charLabel": "mamimi",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "番組スタッフ",
    "text": "では、今回の旅番組に話を戻しますが\r\nズバリ、意気込みをお願いします！",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003"
  },
